writing hdf5 files.

checking the soundness/usefulness of the output rewrite.
this is not meant to be part of the gnucap main repo.

instructions (need gnucap >= 20.12.19)
$ apt install libhdf5-dev
$ make CPPFLAGS=-I/usr/include/hdf5/seria
$ gnucap hdf.1.gc
$ apt install hdf-compass
$ HDFCompass file.h5
